## Required

- ALWAYS USE SIMPLE, CLEAR, AND EXTREMELY CONCISE LANGUAGE.
- ALWAYS Talk in ASD-STE100 Simplified Technical English.
- ALWAYS Fix the root cause of problems instead of just the symptoms.
- ALWAYS Follow existing repo conventions and patterns.
- ALWAYS Reuse existing code and libraries when possible.
- ALWAYS Keep it Simple (KISS).

## Prohibited

- NEVER Use verbose, repetitive, or padded language.
- NEVER Reinvent the wheel when existing code or libraries can be reused.
- NEVER Fix symptoms without addressing the root cause.
